n class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">اً م</span>َّعَ أَثْقَالِهِمْ‌ۖ وَلَيُسْــَٔلُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ يَوْمَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقِيَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>مَةِ عَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا كَانُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> يَفْتَر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٣</span>"},{"id":14,"tajweed":"وَلَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> أَرْسَلْنَا نُوحًا إِلَىٰ قَوْمِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> فَلَبِثَ فِيهِمْ أَلْفَ سَنَةٍ إِلَّا خَمْسِينَ عَا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">مًا ف</span>َأَخَذَهُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>طُّوفَانُ وَهُمْ ظَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٤</span>"},{"id":15,"tajweed":"فَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نج</span>َيْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُ وَأَصْحَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّفِينَةِ وَجَعَلْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> ءَايَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ةً ل</span>ِّلْعَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٥</span>"},{"id":16,"tajweed":"وَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>ر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>هِيمَ إِذْ قَالَ لِقَوْمِهِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>عْبُدُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>تَّقُوهُ‌ۖ ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكُمْ خَيْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">رٌ ل</span>َّكُمْ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>ُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ