يُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>دِئُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْخَلْقَ ثُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ يُعِيدُهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ‌ۚ</span> إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ عَلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ يَس<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٩</span>"},{"id":20,"tajweed":"قُلْ سِيرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نظ</span>ُرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> كَيْفَ بَدَأَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْخَلْقَ‌ۚ ثُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ يُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نش</span>ِئُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َشْأَةَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَخِرَةَ‌ۚ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ ش<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">َىْءٍ ق</span>َد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٠</span>"},{"id":21,"tajweed":"يُعَذِّبُ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ وَيَرْحَمُ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ‌ۖ وَإِلَيْهِ تُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>لَب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢١</span>"},{"id":22,"tajweed":"وَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِمُعْجِزِينَ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ وَلَا فِى <span 