n class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ةٍ ل</span>َّا تَحْمِلُ رِزْقَهَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ يَرْزُقُهَا وَإِيَّاكُمْ‌ۚ وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمِيعُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٠</span>"},{"id":61,"tajweed":"وَلَئِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن س</span>َأَلْتَه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>َّنْ خَلَقَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضَ وَسَخَّرَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّمْسَ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَمَرَ لَيَقُولُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ‌ۖ فَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َىٰ يُؤْفَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦١</span>"},{"id":62,"tajweed":"ٱللَّهُ يَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>سُطُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رِّزْقَ لِم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ مِنْ عِبَادِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> وَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>دِرُ لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ‌ۚ</span> إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٢</span>"},{"id":63,"tajweed":"وَلَئِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن س</span>َأَلْتَه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ن</span>َّزَّلَ مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ