l\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ لَمَعَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُحْسِن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٩</span>"}]}